      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Welcome to the club. I almost can't believe more people start to notice the same issue I've had for a whole year. One of my worlds is called Virtual Week-ality, it's a world made primarily for news, but it's over 300 MB in size because of all the content presented in there. The fact you can't even use web panels is extremely frustrating, and it's been driving me crazy for months, at first I was convinced that they wanted to ruin my project on purpose, but at this point I'm sure they just don't care about content creators as much as others. Regardless of their priorities, I'm afraid the best/worst advice I've got with this issue is, \"If you want something done right, do it yourself.\"",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
