      "value": "@{59c0e5cd39a9874475bcbfd7|full_name}: I didn't think about this before, but is there a way to create a window that links to an outside source of still images?  This might be what you mean by web panels but is there any way?  If you can live stream in a world I would think you could do something similar with live streaming to a still image.",
