      "value": "@{59c0e5cd39a9874475bcbfd7|full_name}:  I'll have to look into video panels but it would seem to make sense that I could have a permanent link to a looped youtube video of my artwork fading from one image to the next.. And make it a permanent unchangeable link that only I, as the world owner, could change whenever I visited my world.  Is that even possible?",
