  "details": "I am wishing to create an art gallery world where others can submit their artwork as well as uploading my own new works.  I don't know of any way to update a world with new items without creating a new world thus killing the existing one.  I wish there was a way I could have users send me an image on discord and I could place it in the existing gallery.  Is there already a way to do this?",
